{"id":"n57628-1-9","stage":3,"title":"반팔 · 短袖","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57628-1-9-1","ko":"엄마, 다음 주부터 날이 훌쩍 더워진대요.","zh":"妈妈，从下周开始天气会突然变热的哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주부터","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주부터","audio":"/audio/2beadcb0ad7b5ddd139b.mp3"}},{"text":"날이","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날：天气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"3","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날이","audio":"/audio/fecb7256d8859fcee381.mp3"}},{"text":"훌쩍","meaning":"比一般情况更大或变大的样子。","explanation":"훌쩍：比一般情况更大或变大的样子。","readings":[{"term":"훌쩍","audio":"/audio/4144f14d3e1ac020bbd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92042","senseId":"5","lemma":"훌쩍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훌쩍","audio":"/audio/4144f14d3e1ac020bbd6.mp3"}},{"text":"더워진대요.","meaning":"热，暑；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더워진대요","audio":"/audio/aea398abd7c8b06625a2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"每一天的雨、云、风、气温等的状态。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"4144f14d3e1ac020","term":"훌쩍","zh":"比一般情况更大或变大的样子。","audio":"/audio/4144f14d3e1ac020bbd6.mp3","entryId":"92042","definition":"比一般情况更大或变大的样子。","pronunciation":["훌쩍"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52ea0a37054a24f0869b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57628-1-9-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 일요일에 옷장에서 반팔 옷을 좀 꺼내야겠다.","zh":"是吗？那周日我得从衣柜里拿出些短袖衣服了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"일요일에","meaning":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","explanation":"일요일：星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일요일","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30198","senseId":"1","lemma":"일요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일요일에","audio":"/audio/a62ae93dc083392ee70d.mp3"}},{"text":"옷장에서","meaning":"衣橱，衣柜","explanation":"옷장：衣橱，衣柜；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"옷장","audio":"/audio/69d674f79595c850af31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68496","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷장에서","audio":"/audio/0c48defb40524d91cef8.mp3"}},{"text":"반팔","meaning":"短袖，半袖","explanation":"반팔：短袖，半袖","readings":[{"term":"반팔","audio":"/audio/240a1262715e0de076fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57628","senseId":"1","lemma":"반팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반팔","audio":"/audio/240a1262715e0de076fd.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼내야겠다.","meaning":"拿出，掏出，取出","explanation":"꺼내다：拿出，掏出，取出；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"꺼내다","audio":"/au